  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M.Kavitha vs The State Of Tamilnadu on 5 November, 2025 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K. Ilanthiraiyan W In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 05-11-2025 Coram The Honourable Mr Justice G.K. Ilanthiraiyan Wp No. 40653 of 2025 and Wmp Nos.45581 & 5582 of 2025 1. M.Kavitha 2.C.Murukesan 3.R.Justin Raj Vs 1. The State Of Tamilnadu Rep. By Its Secretary To Government, Health And Family Welfare (c2) Department Fort St.George Chennai 09 2.The Principal Secretary/ Commissioner Tamil Nadu Food Safety Department Page No.1/8 M.Kavitha vs The State Of Tamilnadu on 5 November, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/166682027/ 1 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis ( Uploaded on: 12/12/2025 01:44:47 pm ) Teynampet Chennai 06 3.The Member Secretary Medical Services Recruitment Board 7th Floor Dms Buildings 359 Anna Salai Teynampet Chennai 06 4.N.Divya 5.A.Alphin Punitha 6.S.Gunachandhiran Prayer Writ petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of Indi praying for issuance of a writ of Certiorarified Mandamus calling for th records of the proceedings of the 3rd respondent dated 11.09.2025 having No. Psl No. 15/ Mrb/ 2025 under which 3 candidates namely respondents 4 6 herein have been selected provisionally for appointment to the post of Laboratory Technician Grade Ii in Tamil Nadu Food Safety Subordinate Ser referring to Notification No. 10/ Mrb/ 2025 dated 9.07.2025 quash the sa illegal in so far as the said selection has been made based on weightage marks and consequently forbear the 2nd respondent from issuing appointme and posting orders to the said 3 candidates as Laboratory Technician Gra Tamil Nadu Food safety subordinate service referring to the proceedings 11.09.2025 having Ref. No. Psl No. 15/ Mrb/ 2025 of the 3rd respondent. For Petitioner(s): Mrs.C.Uma Page No.2/8 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis",
    "facts": "Even before the filing of the Writ Petition, a notification dated 09.07.2025 had been issued calling for applications for recruitment to the post of Laboratory Technician GradeII in the Tamil Nadu Food Safety Subordinate Service. When the petitioner earlier challenged G.O.Ms.No.401, Health and Family Welfare (C2) Department, dated 16.12.2014, before this Court, the notification dated 09.07.2025 was very much in existence. However, the petitioners did not challenge the notification dated 09.07.2025 along with G.O.Ms.No.401 dated 16.12.2014.",
